{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604910/extras/ezgif-3a6047d5150eb9.gif?t=1745416996\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a world of talking animals, hidden passages, suspicious walls, and secrets that don\u2019t want to stay secret. You are a capybara on a journey to find your way back home... but that doesn\u2019t mean you can\u2019t enjoy the adventure along the way...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wander through cozy forests, misty caves, snowy mountains, and places you technically weren\u2019t invited to. Solve puzzles, press strange buttons, drink suspicious potions, and unravel mysteries. Not everything makes sense \u2014 and that\u2019s part of the fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604910/extras/ezgif-6a11de96c88c6f.gif?t=1745416996\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A vibrant world full of surprises</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Optional side quests and conversations with strangely charming animals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new abilities to revisit old areas and reach unexplored places.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hidden rooms, secret walls, and playful mysteries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Small, fun side activities scattered throughout the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Soft, pixel-perfect pixel art visuals.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are not a hero in this world. You\u2019re not even sure you\u2019re supposed to be here. But there are fruits to find, secrets to uncover, and animals waiting to be mildly confused by your presence.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3604910?t=1745416996","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604910/69ddba7ac759cf7575bd351f371070f6fbde1d27/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745416996","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604910/2f74eb3b3be6c2ed13f39c662143bdcaa716fa6e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745416996","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604910/2f74eb3b3be6c2ed13f39c662143bdcaa716fa6e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745416996","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604910/extras/ezgif-3a6047d5150eb9.gif?t=1745416996\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a world of talking animals, hidden passages, suspicious walls, and secrets that don\u2019t want to stay secret. You are a capybara on a journey to find your way back home... but that doesn\u2019t mean you can\u2019t enjoy the adventure along the way...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wander through cozy forests, misty caves, snowy mountains, and places you technically weren\u2019t invited to. Solve puzzles, press strange buttons, drink suspicious potions, and unravel mysteries. Not everything makes sense \u2014 and that\u2019s part of the fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604910/extras/ezgif-6a11de96c88c6f.gif?t=1745416996\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A vibrant world full of surprises</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Optional side quests and conversations with strangely charming animals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new abilities to revisit old areas and reach unexplored places.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hidden rooms, secret walls, and playful mysteries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Small, fun side activities scattered throughout the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Soft, pixel-perfect pixel art visuals.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are not a hero in this world. You\u2019re not even sure you\u2019re supposed to be here. But there are fruits to find, secrets to uncover, and animals waiting to be mildly confused by your presence.</p>","developers":["Vinicius de Moraes"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604910/6df15acf4bc61cf4d83bda69f0d7df5255874136/header.jpg?t=1745416996","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257129814,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257129814/movie480.mp4?t=1745416994","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257129814/movie_max.mp4?t=1745416994"},"name":"Capybound Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257129814/7096bbc552dd57c46a4575b08edcb200f23ea877/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745416994","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257129814/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1745416994","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257129814/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1745416994"}}],"name":"Capybound","package_groups":[],"pc_require